## Project Overview
**Project Name**: Local AI Development Platform  
**Goal**: Modular, portable, local-first AI coding assistant for consumer hardware  
**Current Phase**: ALL PHASES COMPLETED ✅  
**Previous Phase**: Phase 9 - Testing (COMPLETED)  
**Start Date**: 2026-08-14  
**Last Updated**: 2026-08-15 18:05  

## Architecture
- **Interface Layer**: CLI, Web UI
- **Agent Layer**: Conversation management, context, planning, tool execution, memory, permissions
- **Provider Layer**: LLM provider abstraction (llama.cpp initially)
- **Engine Layer**: llama.cpp inference engine
- **Model Layer**: GGUF models with registry-based management

## Target Hardware
- 8 GB RAM
- Intel Core i3 10th generation
- No dedicated GPU
- SSD storage
- Linux and Windows support

## Technology Stack
- **Models**: GGUF quantized models (Qwen2.5-Coder 1.5B-3B)
- **Inference**: llama.cpp
- **Architecture**: Modular, cross-platform, CPU-friendly

